        "text": "I have no idea how this hostel has a high rating. Actually this one star is only for the staff working there, apart from that it is not good at all. The beds are terrible, pillows are almost flat, mattresses are dirty, even the lockers didn’t have hinges to lock them from, one staff had to bring someone to fix it. Bathrooms’ doors don’t even lock and the door was almost broken. The whole place looked dirty and very old, it looked like it could collapse any moment. And the morning we were leaving and were in a rush to get to the bus station, there was no running water, so we couldn’t even shower (not a big loss, the showers were horrendous). The location is good tho!",
        "author": "Sherif Amer",
        "rating": 1,
        "source_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100681200485774408307/reviews"
      },
      {
        "text": "The staff was very kind and attentive.",
        "author": "Maria Ximena Olarte",
        "rating": 5,
        "source_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114669300423206541064/reviews"
      },
      {
        "text": "Un hostel genial, con su mistica nordica. Al lado de la emblematica torre del agua de Mar del Plata este lugar dá una vista única a la mísma y a su predio. El hospedaje está muy bien. Tíene una entrada cálida con sillones confortables y lindero el comedor que invita a compartir. Cocína amplia y equipada. Habitaciones compartidas, muy comodas y calefaccionadas. Posee un patio con espacio para estar y parrilla. También terraza con espacio para sentarse y apreciar la vista.\n\nRecomendado.",
        "author": "Nicolas Iglesias",
        "rating": 4,
        "source_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101812732439434778335/reviews"
      }
    ],
